~:text=Hours%20later%2C%20Ruzi%20and,edge%20of%20the%20Rubblebelt.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"In Praise of the Worldsoul, Part 1\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 25 Sep 2012."}},{"id":"in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2-e0","era":null,"summary":"Cecilee, mute from childhood, suddenly speaks in a beautiful recitation in praise of Selesnya at Vitu-Ghazi, and the dryads call her a conduit to the Worldsoul.","participants":["cecilee","trostani","ruzi"],"location":"vitu-ghazi","importance":"major","page":"stories/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2","order":369,"story_date":"2012-10-03","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":9,"quote":"And then one day Cecilee did speak.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2#:~:text=And%20then%20one%20day%20Cecilee%20did%20speak.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"In Praise of the Worldsoul, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-10-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2#:~:text=And%20then%20one%20day%20Cecilee%20did%20speak.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"In Praise of the Worldsoul, Part 2\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Oct 2012."}},{"id":"in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2-e1","era":null,"summary":"Feeling called to establish a settlement in the Rubblebelt, Cecilee ignores Ruzi's warnings and leads twenty followers there.","participants":["cecilee","ruzi"],"location":"rubblebelt","importance":"major","page":"stories/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2","order":369,"story_date":"2012-10-03","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":13,"quote":"And so she went, leading twenty followers, to the wildest place any of them could imagine.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2#:~:text=And%20so%20she%20went%2C,of%20them%20could%20imagine.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"In Praise of the Worldsoul, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-10-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2#:~:text=And%20so%20she%20went%2C,of%20them%20could%20imagine.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"In Praise of the Worldsoul, Part 2\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Oct 2012."}},{"id":"in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2-e2","era":null,"summary":"Cecilee adopts an abandoned infant with a Gruul tattoo and names him Ruzi, calling him Zi.","participants":["cecilee","zi"],"location":"cecilee-s-vernadi","importance":"major","page":"stories/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2","order":369,"story_date":"2012-10-03","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":7,"quote":"Cecilee named the child after her brother, Ruzi, and took him into her home to raise as her own son.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2#:~:text=Cecilee%20named%20the%20child,as%20her%20own%20son.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"In Praise of the Worldsoul, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-10-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2#:~:text=Cecilee%20named%20the%20child,as%20her%20own%20son.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"In Praise of the Worldsoul, Part 2\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Oct 2012."}},{"id":"in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2-e3","era":null,"summary":"A Gruul shaman from Nikya's clan comes to take Zi back, but Cecilee refuses, and the Gruul begin attacking the Selesnyans.","participants":["cecilee","zi","nikya","gruul-clans"],"location":"cecilee-s-vernadi","importance":"major","page":"stories/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2","order":369,"story_date":"2012-10-03","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":15,"quote":"After Cecilee adopted Zi, the Gruul sent a woman to take him back.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2#:~:text=After%20Cecilee%20adopted%20Zi%2C,to%20take%20him%20back.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"In Praise of the Worldsoul, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-10-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2#:~:text=After%20Cecilee%20adopted%20Zi%2C,to%20take%20him%20back.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"In Praise of the Worldsoul, Part 2\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Oct 2012."}},{"id":"in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2-e4","era":null,"summary":"Before sunrise, an ogre breaks through the gate followed by Massacre Girl and her men, who are not Gruul.","participants":["massacre-girl","cecilee"],"location":"cecilee-s-vernadi","importance":"major","page":"stories/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2","order":369,"story_date":"2012-10-03","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":17,"quote":"Just before sunrise, their gate flew off the hinges and splintered on the ground.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/in-praise-of-the-worldsoul-part-2#:~:text=Just%20before%20sunrise%2C%20their,splintered%20on%20the%20ground.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"In Praise of the Worldsoul, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"dat